{"about_the_game":"The apocalypse is over. The dead are hungry. And you're running the only diner in town.<br><br>Welcome to Zombie Diner, a unique blend of diner management, survival, and gruesome gastronomy. In a world where civilization has collapsed, the undead have developed a taste for the finer things in undeath\u2014namely, expertly prepared human cuisine. You're the chef, and business is booming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/7889d2e29bdb3832702c89ef5661ca62.avif?t=1765454217\" width=800 height=353 /></span><br><br>Order fresh ingredients (sourced in questionable ways), manage your pantry, and craft a menu of horrifyingly delicious meals. From &quot;Brain Tacos&quot; to &quot;Sloppy Joes,&quot; every dish needs precision and a steady hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/49db758b48f1171188fa7c441b2f721a.avif?t=1765454217\" width=800 height=357 /></span><br><br>When the sun goes down, the customers crawl out. Take orders from your discerning zombie clientele and serve them quickly before their patience (and your reputation) runs out. The faster you are, the more money you'll earn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/ad62c8cacccac2d50b1392ba8c6e6a4d.avif?t=1765454217\" width=800 height=359 /></span><br><br>Not every customer is a five-star patron. If a zombie's hunger timer runs out, they'll forget their manners and come for your brains instead of your food. Grab your trusty shotgun and defend your livelihood in a frantic, life-or-death struggle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/711a7ffd55c0c9b30f365f93b2199522.avif?t=1765454217\" width=800 height=389 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048550?t=1765454217","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048550?t=1765454217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/b7b5bbd58d1a29dfb824da7b88104bddd3ffb482/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765454217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/b7b5bbd58d1a29dfb824da7b88104bddd3ffb482/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765454217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contain depictions of blood, and internal organs. It also includes mild violence and horror elements that may not be suitable for all audiences."},"detailed_description":"The apocalypse is over. The dead are hungry. And you're running the only diner in town.<br><br>Welcome to Zombie Diner, a unique blend of diner management, survival, and gruesome gastronomy. In a world where civilization has collapsed, the undead have developed a taste for the finer things in undeath\u2014namely, expertly prepared human cuisine. You're the chef, and business is booming.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/7889d2e29bdb3832702c89ef5661ca62.avif?t=1765454217\" width=800 height=353 /></span><br><br>Order fresh ingredients (sourced in questionable ways), manage your pantry, and craft a menu of horrifyingly delicious meals. From &quot;Brain Tacos&quot; to &quot;Sloppy Joes,&quot; every dish needs precision and a steady hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048550/extras/49db758b48f1171188fa7c441b2f721a.avif?t=1765454217\"